Title: Meas exception for TRS config in RF test cases Reason for change: TRS are required for RF testing, as defined in 38.521-1 and 38.521-2, annex A. Corresponding messages exceptions are defined in 38.508-1, section 5.4.1. However, one exception is needed to allow that configuration take effect. (Editorial) table number is discontinuous for last 2 tables in the section. Summary of change: Added table 5.4.1-12 to activate csi-MeasConfig in case of TRS. Renumbered tables 5.4.1-16 and 5.4.1-17 as 5.4.1-13 and 5.4.1-14 Consequences if not approved: Message exception will remain misaligned with required RF tests conditions. Clauses affected: 5.4.1

